  cookingInstructions:
  - Slice the squid.
  - Mince the garlic.
  - Mince the onion.
  - Slice the cabbage.
  - Slice the celery.
  - Slice the tomato.
  - Turn the stove to high heat.
  - Put the wok on the stove.
  - Add 1/3 cup of cooking oil.
  - Add the garlic.
  - Add the bay leaf.
  - Add onion
  - Add the tomato.
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula."
  - Add the squid.
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula until cooked."
  - Set aside the cooked squid on a plate.
  - Add the cabbage.
  - Add water.
  - Add the squid ink.
  - Add 1/3 cup of soy sauce.
  - Add 1 tbsp of fish sauce.
  - Stir using the spatula.
  - Put the lid on the pan to simmer.
  - Add the bihon noodles.
  - Return the squid to the wok.
  - Add the celery for toppings
